    "explanation" : "Since: PMD 3.4\n\nConsider replacing Hashtable usage with the newer java.util.Map if thread safety is not required.\n\nExample(s):\n```\npublic class Foo {\n    void bar() {\n        Hashtable h = new Hashtable();\n    }\n}\n```",
